        getNativeType(JSTypeNative.STRING_VALUE_OR_OBJECT_TYPE));
  }

  /**
   * Tests whether the type is a number (value or Object).
   * @return {@code this &lt;: (Number, number)}
   */
  public final boolean isNumber() {
